  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "音樂賦格與永續行動：那些年，音樂改變了全世界",
    "sub_ename": "MUSICAL FUGUE AND SUSTAINABLE ACTION: IN THOSE YEARS, MUSIC CHANGED THE WORLD",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以歷代的音樂發展與跨國的世界音樂為出發點，透過分析古典音樂與世界音樂的多樣案例，探討聯合國永續發展目標（SDGs）的理念，培養學生從國際觀的視野，藉由專題報告中深化自身所關注的議題，讓學生理解音樂跨領域的影響力與社會實踐的可能性，研究音樂的永續理念和實踐的精神，提升學生音樂實踐能力與永續意識，尊重本土文化並促進文化傳承，進而將理念落實於生活與社會中，實現音樂與永續共榮的目標。",
    "describe_eh": "This course takes the development of music throughout history and transnational world music as its starting point. Through analyzing diverse cases of classical and world music, it explores the concepts of the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). The course aims to cultivate students' international perspectives and deepen their understanding of issues they care about through project reports. It helps students grasp the interdisciplinary influence of music and the possibilities for social practice, studying the spirit of sustainability and practical implementation in music. The course enhances students' musical practice skills and sustainability awareness, respects local cultures, and promotes cultural heritage. Ultimately, it seeks to apply these concepts to everyday life and society, achieving the goal of harmonious coexistence between music and sustainability.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解音樂在文化、社會、民族與環境永續中的多重角色與影響力。",
      "describe_en": "Understand the multiple roles and influences of music in culture, society, ethnicity, and environmental sustainability."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "培養跨文化與跨議題的音樂理解力與批判思維。",
      "describe_en": "Cultivate cross-cultural and interdisciplinary musical understanding and critical thinking."
    }
  ],
